
Instructions for building and publishing a new update site:

* Commit all changes

* Be sure that the JMLAnnotations, OpenJMLsrc, OpenJMLUI, and Specs
  projects are built without errors and all unit and release tests pass

* FIXME - use the TBD script to set the new version number in the relevant.xml
  files and to push the new version of the plugin to the update site.

* Publish to https://openjml.org/eclipse-update-site by running
  git commit and git push in your local copy of the openjml.github.io repo.
